Jason: Alright here we go!

5
00:00:10,360 --> 00:00:13,200
麦琪∶杰森!克莉丝和我在车里都等累了.
Maggie: Jason!Chrissy and I are getting tired of waiting out in the car.

6
00:00:13,380 --> 00:00:14,200
你说过三十秒内比赛就要结束的.
You said the game would be over in thirty seconds.

7
00:00:15,480 --> 00:00:17,020
杰森∶好消息,亲爱的,
Jason: Great news, honey, the Knicks just tied it up,

8
00:00:17,120 --> 00:00:18,000
比分打平了,还有加时赛呢!
we're heading into overtime!

9
00:00:18,220 --> 00:00:19,200
麦琪∶不,我们不想等了,我们要送克莉丝去托儿所了.
Maggie: No, we're not.We're going to Chrissy's playschool.

10
00:00:20,620 --> 00:00:24,240
杰森∶放松,放松,外面不会有交通堵塞的.只要是美国人,都在看这个比赛.
Jason: Hon...honey, hey, relax, relax, there's not gonna be any traffic out there.Everybody

11
00:00:24,240 --> 00:00:25,520
who calls himself an American is watching this game

12
00:00:27,300 --> 00:00:28,940
麦琪∶杰森!什么更重要,
Maggie: Jason!What's more important here,

13
00:00:29,040 --> 00:00:30,100
是愚蠢的比赛还是克莉丝上学的第一天?
this silly game or Chrissy's first day at school?

14
00:00:31,740 --> 00:00:33,220
杰森∶我刚才有提到加时吗?我来了,
Jason: Hey, hey, hey, did I mention it was overtime?

15
00:00:34,740 --> 00:00:35,980
我来了,我来了.
I'm coming, I'm coming, I'm coming.

16
00:00:36,640 --> 00:00:38,260
开萝尔∶还好,你们还在这里.
Carol: Good, you guys are still here.

17
00:00:38,860 --> 00:00:41,640
给你克莉丝,
Here Chrissy, it's my old animal pencil case,

18
00:00:41,640 --> 00:00:43,500
这是我的旧的动物铅笔盒,还有大象橡皮和斑马卷笔刀.
with the elephant eraser and the zebra sharpener.

19
00:00:43,500 --> 00:00:46,900
麦琪∶哦,你真是太懂事了,不是...亲爱的!
Maggie: Oh, it's so sweet of you, isn't it hon...Honey!

20
00:00:46,900 --> 00:00:50,100
杰森∶好了,好了,正在穿外套.
Jason: Yep, yep, yep.Just putting on my coat.

21
00:00:50,840 --> 00:00:51,100
麦琪∶你已经穿了外套.
Maggie: You're wearing your coat.

22
00:00:51,100 --> 00:00:53,500
杰森∶我们还有几分钟.
Jason: OK, then we have a couple more minutes.

23
00:00:53,500 --> 00:00:55,500
迈克∶爸爸,我的学前班的第一天,你有带我去吗?
Mike: Dad, did you take me to my first day at pre-school?

24
00:00:56,320 --> 00:01:00,040
杰森∶是的,是的,因此而错过了世界锦标赛的第7场比赛.
Jason: Yeah, yeah.Missed the seventh game of the world series because of you.

25
00:01:00,260 --> 00:01:01,060
本∶那我呢?
Ben: What about me?

26
00:01:01,300 --> 00:01:02,560
杰森∶错过了里根-卡特的辩论.
Jason: Missed the Reagan-Carter debate.

27
00:01:02,860 --> 00:01:04,140
所以这是我为什么一直最喜欢你的原因.
That's why you've always been my favourite.

28
00:01:05,080 --> 00:01:06,540
麦琪∶杰森,如果你不想去..
Maggie: Look Jason if you don't wanna go...

29
00:01:07,520 --> 00:01:09,220
杰森∶我想去!我来了!
Jason: I wanna go!I'm coming!I wanna go!

30
00:01:09,480 --> 00:01:12,660
我想去!我一直在等开萝尔停止唠叨,这样我们就可以出发了.
I've been waiting for Carol to stop babbling here so we could hit the road.

31
00:01:13,880 --> 00:01:17,040
开萝尔∶妈妈,爸爸,
Carol: Mom, Dad, I just think it's wonderful that you two are willing

32
00:01:17,040 --> 00:01:19,860
在你们这样的年龄,仍然还愿意与克莉丝重新开始,真是太棒了.
to start all over again with Chrissy, at your age.

33
00:01:20,480 --> 00:01:24,560
刚好昨天晚上欧波拉的节目中,有一段是讲家属与孩子的.
Just yesterday there was a segment on Operah, People with Kids.

34
00:02:27,560 --> 00:02:29,940
教师∶所有人都准备好了牙刷吗?
Teacher: Is everybody ready for the toothbrush?

35
00:02:29,940 --> 00:02:30,040
孩子们∶是的!
Kids: Yeah!

36
00:02:31,880 --> 00:02:36,100
教师∶大家都来刷牙齿!准备,开始!
Teacher: Everybody brush your teeth!Ready, this is it!

37
00:02:36,100 --> 00:02:39,000
上下,左右,大家都坐下!
Up and down, all around, everybody sit!

38
00:02:43,900 --> 00:02:45,840
麦琪∶杰森,他们是如此年轻的.
Maggie: Jason, they're so young.

39
00:02:46,180 --> 00:02:47,580
杰森∶当然年轻了,亲爱的,他们才2岁.
Jason: Course they're young, honey, they're two.

40
00:02:48,120 --> 00:02:49,840
麦琪∶不是孩子们,是父母们.
Maggie: Not the kids, the parents.

41
00:02:50,160 --> 00:02:51,900
麦琪∶哦,他们没有你说的那么年轻.
Jason: Oh, they're not all that young.

42
00:02:52,620 --> 00:02:55,500
劳瑞∶劳驾,西维尔医生和西维尔太太,我是劳瑞卡特利吉,曾经和迈克约会过.
Laurie: Excuse me, Dr.and Mrs.Seaver, I'm Laurie McNeill, I used to date Mike.

43
00:02:55,500 --> 00:02:56,600
杰森∶哦!劳瑞你好.
Jason: Oh, yeah, hi Laurie.

44
00:02:56,600 --> 00:02:58,300
劳瑞∶你好.
Laurie: Hi.Hi.

45
00:02:58,300 --> 00:03:00,000
麦琪∶你的宝宝真好看.
Maggie: Hi.And you have a beautiful baby.

46
00:03:02,200 --> 00:03:03,540
劳瑞∶谢谢,他叫迦南.
Laurie: Thank you, this is Canaan.

47
00:03:03,980 --> 00:03:04,780
麦琪∶你好迦南.
Maggie: Hi Canaan.

48
00:03:05,560 --> 00:03:08,360
杰森∶啊,他也有和迈克一样的酒涡呢.
Jason: Yeah, look at that, he's got dimples just like Mike.

49
00:03:08,440 --> 00:03:10,240
劳瑞∶那是有原因的.
Laurie: Yeah, there's a reason for that.

50
00:03:10,240 --> 00:03:10,340
杰森∶哈?
Jason: Huh?

51
00:03:11,840 --> 00:03:13,880
劳瑞∶他的爸爸也有像迈克一样的酒窝.
Laurie: His Daddy has dimples like Mike's too.

52
00:03:13,880 --> 00:03:13,980
麦琪∶哦!他的爸爸也有!
Maggie: Oh, his Daddy does!

53
00:03:13,980 --> 00:03:14,100
劳瑞∶是.
Laurie: Yes.

54
00:03:14,100 --> 00:03:14,800
麦琪∶哦!
Maggie: Oh.

55
00:03:14,800 --> 00:03:16,900
杰森∶哦!太好了!
Jason: Oh, that's wonderful.

56
00:03:16,900 --> 00:03:18,300
劳瑞∶很高兴见到你们.
Laurie: It was nice seeing you guys.

57
00:03:22,500 --> 00:03:25,560
杰森∶哦,真是受打击.
Jason: Oh, so that's what a stroke feels like.

58
00:03:26,440 --> 00:03:28,540
教师∶你好,我是萨莉艾罗嘉纳,欢迎!
Teacher: Hi, I'm Sally Garner, welcome!

59
00:03:29,400 --> 00:03:32,380
麦琪∶你好.麦琪和杰森西维尔,这是克莉丝.
Maggie: Hi, Maggie and Jason Seaver and this is Chrissy.

60
00:03:32,600 --> 00:03:35,400
教师∶你好克莉丝,很高兴你能来我们班.
Teacher: Hi Chrissy, I am so glad you are in our class.

61
00:03:35,480 --> 00:03:36,380
麦琪∶谢谢.
Maggie: Well thanks.

62
00:03:36,480 --> 00:03:38,700
教师∶很多年轻的父母一定可以从你们的成熟经验中获益匪浅.
Teacher: You know all the young parents can certainly profit from your mature experience

63
00:03:40,800 --> 00:03:44,100
麦琪∶成熟!对,我们还真的计划传达我们在第二次世界大战期间学到的东西.
Maggie: Mature!Well, we do plan to pass on so much of what we learned during world war two.

64
00:03:44,100 --> 00:03:45,700
教师∶当真??
Teacher: Really?

65
00:03:45,700 --> 00:03:49,300
杰森∶不,不,不,不,我的妻子只不过是开个小玩笑而已.
Jason: Na, na, na, na, I think my wife was just making a little joke there.

66
00:03:51,760 --> 00:03:53,400
教师∶你使我想起了我的妈妈,她总是讲冷笑话.
Teacher: You remind me of my mom, she's always making jokes that nobody gets.

67
00:03:53,400 --> 00:03:55,400
麦琪∶很荣幸.
Maggie: How nice.

68
00:03:57,560 --> 00:03:58,580
教师∶来克莉丝!
Teacher: Come on Chrissy!

69
00:03:58,800 --> 00:03:58,900
我要带你去见见一些新朋友.
I have some new friends over here that I want you to meet.

70
00:03:58,900 --> 00:04:05,400
杰森∶麦琪,别当它是针对你而说的,她只是一个孩子.麦琪!
Jason: Come on Maggie, don't take it personally.She's just a kid.Maggie!

71
00:04:08,960 --> 00:04:11,300
麦琪∶杰森,我们是这里最最老的父母.
Maggie: Jason, we're the oldest parents here.

72
00:04:11,620 --> 00:04:18,780
杰森∶我们不是!你看那里也有我们一样年龄的家伙.哈罗,看上去很好玩.
Jason: We are not!Come on, there's a guy our age.Hello, that looks like fun.

73
00:04:19,000 --> 00:04:21,340
男人∶是的,等等,宝贝儿.
Man: It sure is.Hang on, honey.

74
00:04:22,000 --> 00:04:23,700
麦琪∶你女儿真的很可爱.
Maggie: Your daughter sure is adorable.

75
00:04:24,300 --> 00:04:28,160
男人∶孙女.孙女.
Man: Granddaughter.Granddaughter.Yep,

76
00:04:28,160 --> 00:04:31,320
我的孩子们让我帮他们带孩子.
my kids stuck Grandpa with babysitting duty again.

77
00:04:31,800 --> 00:04:31,900
很显然的,你们也是一样.
But obviously you two know how that goes.

78
00:04:31,900 --> 00:04:40,300
麦琪∶10点15分了,杰森,10点15分了.
Maggie: It's ten fifteen, Jason, ten fifteen.

79
00:04:43,340 --> 00:04:46,820
杰森∶麦琪,别紧张,本只不过是迟到了15分钟的晚钟.
Jason: Maggie, easy, come on, Ben's only fifteen minutes late for his curfew.

80
00:04:46,900 --> 00:04:48,760
麦琪∶经历了白天的事情后,我现在再也不想这样了!
Maggie: I don't need this after the day had!

81
00:04:49,100 --> 00:04:51,680
杰森∶我们经历的事情和本迟到晚钟有什么关系?
Jason: What does the day we had have to do with Ben blowing curfew?

82
00:04:52,020 --> 00:04:54,820
麦琪∶所有事物.杰森,
Maggie: Everything.Jason, do realise that we're going to be creaming kids

83
00:04:54,820 --> 00:04:57,460
要记得我们还需要为这些跟孩子们说16年.
for missing curfews for at least another sixteen years.

84
00:04:58,520 --> 00:05:00,180
到那时,我肯定头发都已经白了.
By then I'll look like one of the Golden Girls.

85
00:05:01,320 --> 00:05:03,260
杰森∶麦琪,不要拿那个开玩笑.
Jason: Maggie, don't even joke about that.

86
00:05:05,040 --> 00:05:06,380
麦琪∶我没有,杰森,
Maggie: I'm not, Jason,

87
00:05:06,400 --> 00:05:09,320
你没有意识到当我们把克莉丝养大后,我会有多老了吗?
do you realise how old I'll be when we're going through this with Chrissy?

88
00:05:09,740 --> 00:05:14,100
杰森∶是.比我再一岁.我们不应该生她的.
Jason: Yes.A year older than me.Bad time for that one.

89
00:05:14,100 --> 00:05:15,900
迈克∶你好,我要出去一下,不要熬夜等我!
Mike: Hi guys, I'm not here, don't wait up!

90
00:05:15,900 --> 00:05:18,400
杰森∶等等!你现在要出去?已经过了10点了!
Jason: Wait, wait, wait, you're going out now?Come on, it's after ten!

91
00:05:20,800 --> 00:05:20,900
迈克∶好了爸爸,聚会直到至少1点或2点才好玩.
Mike: Come on, Dad, the party won't be going good till at least one or two.

92
00:05:20,900 --> 00:05:21,700
麦琪∶迈克!
Maggie: Mike!

93
00:05:24,300 --> 00:05:26,500
迈克∶别紧张!难道你们2个没有年轻过?
Mike: Guys, guys, lighten up!Weren't you two ever young?

94
00:05:27,680 --> 00:05:29,160
麦琪∶我都回想不起来了.
Maggie: Not that I can recall.

95
00:05:30,880 --> 00:05:31,500
迈克∶啊?我说什么了?
Mike: What'd I say?

96
00:05:31,740 --> 00:05:34,480
杰森∶哦,哪壶不开提哪壶.
Jason: Oh, just the worst possible thing at the worst possible time.

97
00:05:34,780 --> 00:05:35,680
迈克∶我并非有意的.
Mike: I didn't mean it.

98
00:05:35,760 --> 00:05:38,560
杰森∶你有禀赋.出去吧,迈克.
Jason: You've got a gift.Get out, Mike.

99
00:05:38,760 --> 00:05:39,400
迈克∶没问题.
Mike: You got it.

100
00:05:41,300 --> 00:05:42,940
杰森∶宝贝儿,我觉得你反应太激烈了....
Jason: Honey, come on, I think you're over reacting...

101
00:05:46,000 --> 00:05:50,320
有时我会觉得笨手笨脚本让我觉得很开心;这样,就很好管束他了.
You know sometimes I'm glad Ben is such a klutz; it makes him easier to catch.

102
00:05:50,800 --> 00:05:53,780
麦琪∶不,让我来.我现在想要吃人呢.
Maggie: No, let me.I'm in the mood to chew somebody out.

103
00:05:55,800 --> 00:05:56,400
杰森∶最好是他不要是我.
Jason: Better him than me.

104
00:05:56,400 --> 00:06:01,800
麦琪∶本西维尔!站住!你不知道现在几点了吗?
Maggie: Ben Seaver!Freeze!Do you happen to know what time it is, young man?

105
00:06:01,800 --> 00:06:04,300
本∶我的手表现实8点半.晚安.
Ben: My watch says eight thirty.Good night.

106
00:06:04,300 --> 00:06:06,200
麦琪∶已经10点15了,本.
Maggie: It is ten fifteen, Ben.

107
00:06:09,220 --> 00:06:11,600
本∶难怪我觉得今天晚上的时间特别长呢.
Ben: Well that's why the night seemed to drag on and on.

108
00:06:12,060 --> 00:06:14,940
麦琪∶我说站住,我想要知道事实.
Maggie: I said, freeze, Mr.And I want the truth.

109
00:06:15,800 --> 00:06:16,900
本∶哦,妈妈,爸爸,对不起,我想你们不会还没有睡.
Ben: Oh, Mom, Dad, I'm sorry; I didn't think you'd still be awake.

110
00:06:16,900 --> 00:06:19,900
麦琪∶哦,你认为熬夜到晚上10点是很难的吗?
Maggie: Oh, you think it's tough to stay up past ten!

111
00:06:22,020 --> 00:06:23,040
本∶总是这样的.
Ben: It always has been.

112
00:06:23,040 --> 00:06:24,400
杰森∶所以,你就以为你可以溜进来,没有人会知道,对吗?
Jason: So, you just figured you'd just sneak in; nobody'd be the wiser, huh?

113
00:06:27,020 --> 00:06:29,160
本∶重要的难道不是我安全到家了吗?
Ben: Isn't the important thing here, that I'm home safe?

114
00:06:29,500 --> 00:06:30,780
麦琪∶谁说你安全了?
Maggie: Who says you're safe?

115
00:06:32,300 --> 00:06:33,640
杰森∶本,
Jason: Ben, Ben, Ben,

116
00:06:33,640 --> 00:06:36,140
本,本,
don't you think your mother and I are gonna get just a little tired of

117
00:06:36,140 --> 00:06:38,280
你难道不认为你妈妈和我对一次又一次地这样的谈话有点厌卷了吗?
having this conversation over and over again?

118
00:06:38,480 --> 00:06:40,260
本∶那想想我的感受.
Ben: Well, then imagine how I feel.

119
00:06:41,100 --> 00:06:43,440
麦琪∶本,我心情不好,不要把你自己当万事通.
Maggie: Ben, can the wise-guy stuff, I am in no mood.

120
00:06:44,600 --> 00:06:46,720
本∶那么或许我们应该早晨再来谈论这个...
Ben: Well then maybe we should talk about this in the morning...

121
00:06:46,900 --> 00:06:47,680
等你们精神饱满后.
when you're fresh.

122
00:06:48,160 --> 00:06:53,900
麦琪∶我现在就很精神饱满.你已经长大了,必须学会听话了.现在你还有什么要为你自己辩护的吗...最好不要是任何的瞎编的话.
Maggie: I am plenty fresh.Now Ben, this is getting old, you have got to learn to listen.Now, what do you have to say for yourself...and it better not be any back-talk.

123
00:06:53,900 --> 00:06:54,500
本∶恩....
Ben: Well...

124
00:06:56,580 --> 00:06:57,620
麦琪∶也不要跟我说抱歉.
Maggie: And don't tell me you're sorry.

125
00:06:57,620 --> 00:06:57,720
麦琪∶妈妈...
Ben: Mom...

126
00:06:58,060 --> 00:06:58,660
麦琪∶我在等!
Maggie: I'm waiting!

127
00:06:58,660 --> 00:06:58,760
杰森∶麦琪..
Jason: Maggie...

128
00:06:58,760 --> 00:06:58,900
麦琪∶什么?
Maggie: What?

129
00:07:01,080 --> 00:07:02,380
杰森∶你为何不和我到厨房说句话?
Jason: why don't you and I have a word in the kitchen?

130
00:07:02,380 --> 00:07:02,480
麦琪∶啊,杰森,我很忙.
Maggie: Ah, Jason, I am busy here.

131
00:07:03,740 --> 00:07:04,780
杰森∶麦琪,厨房!
Jason: Maggie, the kitchen!

132
00:07:04,780 --> 00:07:04,880
麦琪∶为什么?
Maggie: Why?

133
00:07:05,720 --> 00:07:07,380
杰森∶因为我不想要本看见我们吵架!
Jason: Because I don't want Ben to see us arguing!

134
00:07:09,120 --> 00:07:24,100
麦琪∶本,如果在我们回来前,你动一下,或者是想动一下的的话,我,我一定会作出难以置信的举动!杰森,你要说什么?什么?我马上就要把事情摆平了.我是说,他应该知道我能解决事情,我们已经提前一步了!
Maggie: Ben, if you move, or even think of moving before we get back, I'll...I'll do something incredible!What is it Jason?What?I was just on a roll out there.I mean, he's gotta know that we can keep up with me, that we're one step ahead!

135
00:07:24,100 --> 00:07:26,800
杰森∶麦琪!孩子只不过晚回来了15分钟.
Jason: Aw, Maggie, come on!The kid was just fifteen minutes late.

